.claude/

# agent_bridge/ Node dependencies — fetched via `npm install`, see
# aion-arch/changes/provider-configuration/proposal.md's Non-goals.
agent_bridge/node_modules/

# Aion's own project-bookkeeping data, written by the app itself when
# this checkout is registered as an Aion "project" root for dogfooding
# self-iteration. `/tickets/*.md` and `/.aion/manifest.json` are
# deliberately TRACKED (not ignored) here — this project's own choice
# to reuse its source repo for ticket-data git-projection rather than a
# separate dedicated bookkeeping repo (the latter is the other option
# under discussion, not yet built — see
# aion-arch/ideas/self-iteration-sequencing.md and the follow-up
# per-project bookkeeping-repo-strategy idea). Only `/.aion/data/`
# (the local SQLite DB + its ad hoc backups) stays ignored: it's a
# disposable, fully reconstructable cache of `/tickets/*.md`
# (`TicketDbReconstructionService.reconstruct`), not a durable
# artifact — binary, large, and churns on every write, exactly what
# git shouldn't track. Anchored to the repo root (`/`) — unanchored
# `tickets/` previously matched any directory named `tickets` anywhere
# in the tree, silently hiding new files under the real source
# directory `lib/features/tickets/` from `git status`.
/.aion/data/